{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":365432,\"title\":\"The Sublet\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The Sublet is a suspense driven psychological thriller about Joanna, a new mom coping with her baby alone in an odd sublet apartment. As her husband neglects her to focus on his career, Joanna questions her sanity as she discovers a violent past to the apartment and suspects that the building may be haunted.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/afOTBFYb2ou293LcdXcxuDmN749.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6tCQeVgL3m3ibw6PrqZV21L8f1L.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"voteCount\":39,\"year\":2015,\"runtime\":82,\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"John Ainslie\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":80009,\"name\":\"John Ainslie\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1276175,\"name\":\"Tianna Nori\",\"character\":\"Joanna\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wvdbPuHl3jnx5qk0maoJhSBpAcq.jpg\"},{\"id\":1858110,\"name\":\"Mark Matechuk\",\"character\":\"Jeff\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9yfhk2c3kygYe0liWzxvwqjlUAe.jpg\"},{\"id\":1208342,\"name\":\"Krista Madison\",\"character\":\"Margaret\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a3seIVVeVoe4V9VurxG3SeO5m8Z.jpg\"},{\"id\":1858109,\"name\":\"Porter Randell\",\"character\":\"Porter\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1797078,\"name\":\"Rachel Sellan\",\"character\":\"Alex\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1T4h8GPtXa2B3NWqzJ90whLZGvK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1104715,\"name\":\"Jeff Sinasac\",\"character\":\"Detective Galagher\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/88ppjZyeF0FAlzQX5PiR8UlOX6E.jpg\"},{\"id\":1375342,\"name\":\"Liv Collins\",\"character\":\"Young Woman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eJNpYgY1byABMjlWoJcbgm2qVlG.jpg\"},{\"id\":1867012,\"name\":\"Mary-Elizabeth Willcott\",\"character\":\"Homeless Woman\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1470351,\"name\":\"Janet Porter\",\"character\":\"Shadow\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4dgZ2QZHUPoLwnkhrKFe4ACmTZ0.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1224993,\"title\":\"Dark Nuns\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Abt2GgscAGtGAXTrhH44qPhugI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bQdYYutvomoxfLQK8gTV8Z3qsmv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Desperation drives two nuns to perform an exorcism no nun should attempt. With a possessed child at the mercy of evil and the opposition of the Catholic Church, they take on the dangerous forbidden rituals themselves, putting their immortal souls in grave danger. They must confront the terrifying cost of their sacrilegious actions, but one goal remains: the boy must be saved at all costs.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9913,\"title\":\"The Skeleton Key\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wHmubdzrVw8oq7htzrf364wsJNp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uzHTp5aFmnSBJVkupHlHe2m70gj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A hospice nurse working at a spooky New Orleans plantation home finds herself entangled in a mystery involving the house's dark past.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":63311,\"title\":\"The Skin I Live In\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xa7uCwGYykrf8MMI8iF5dZvNlrG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qLOboFiCtFZXkJJCz0nl5NgXUV1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A brilliant plastic surgeon creates a synthetic skin that withstands any kind of damage. His guinea pig: a mysterious and volatile woman who holds the key to his obsession.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2655,\"title\":\"What Lies Beneath\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1KqWWhMa4At7hY8uSd0aPbuI7jr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dN0Y9PpPjW8pX4ZcdxarzswI2K6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Norman and Claire Spencer are a seemingly happily married couple who uncover a terrible secret… a secret so disturbing it threatens to destroy them.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":36419,\"title\":\"After.Life\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ty43RTdSBpL3VjBJWeRoKhFg7hF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Ircr5htx54lRNaCgahf7KyIgNU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following a terrible car crash, a woman awakes to find an enigmatic mortician preparing her for burial.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2046,\"title\":\"The Gift\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nQdBE1P0r4ZrgGqy5EX8sL2kXG6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r3NNl7chgkT8pUgvozi4PlaBH6P.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Annie Wilson, young widow and mother of three, makes her living foretelling others' futures⁠—though her own has become cloudier than even she can see. Threatened by a client's violent husband and plagued by visions of a missing local woman, Annie finds herself pulled into a thicket of lies and deception in which her extraordinary gift may ultimately get her killed.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299824,\"title\":\"Mojin: The Lost Legend\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/supoIHkh3dzDi1XmvK8tgGlkGNS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/us0mTpTmGCDboPpgddjcw6nYPQH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three tomb raiders retire from their roles and move to New York to enjoy the rest of their lives. However, they are asked to resume duty in order to find out the reason behind the loss of a loved one.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8090,\"title\":\"Untraceable\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ySUwDRDEn01lKIMPQorpFCMLWqE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eIjrpeXSiSq0CN6AE44trDAPRau.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Special Agent Jennifer Marsh works in an elite division of the FBI dedicated to fighting cybercrime. She thinks she has seen it all, until a particularly sadistic criminal arises on the Internet. This tech-savvy killer posts live feeds of his crimes on his website; the more hits the site gets, the faster the victim dies. Marsh and her team must find the elusive killer before time runs out.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20616,\"title\":\"Swimfan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mOAiqOivdVecMu0yhumN6pzDWmo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/asYdN1eS7zvkEJVIQaYqQcqssj6.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ben Cronin has it all: the admiration of his many friends, a terrific girlfriend, and he's on the fast-track to an athletic scholarship. Ben's rock-solid, promising future and romance are turned upside-down with the arrival of Madison Bell. Madison, the new girl in town, quickly sets her sights on the impressionable Ben. While their first few meetings are innocent enough, the obsessive and seductive Madison wants more ... much more.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10004,\"title\":\"Desperation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sVVTUA9SBaGlkZcj3XIJq077dQB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zwgje2ruELJGHEZcSwq287o5Qo3.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a sheriff arrests a writer, a family, a couple, and a hitchiker and throws them in a jail cell in the deserted town of Desperation, they must fight for their lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9616,\"title\":\"The Order\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7kj4TffoKCt4gIrNupr2oqmir69.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7KBJf963tZBijpP6bKOJrxkowGp.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For centuries, a secret Order of priests has existed within the Church. A renegade priest, Father Alex Bernier, is sent to Rome to investigate the mysterious death of one of the Order's most revered members. Following a series of strangely similar killings, Bernier launches an investigation that forces him to confront unimaginable evil.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1215918,\"title\":\"Blackwater Lane\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tdUFd56CFC0o6XoAkn4WRNHwqod.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gMivgcDVJmp8DTwMZ2YLhkJV09V.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An American school teacher in England drives past an abandoned car late one night, unaware that the driver was the victim of a murder. As she comes to terms with the realization, seemingly supernatural events start to affect the gothic manor she lives in with her husband.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"oM8OPxZVkSg\",\"name\":\"The Sublet -Trailer (2016) HD\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}